{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o020b","title":"于禁破吕布二营及高雅","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o020b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"于禁破吕布二营及高雅","evidence":["zhangle-e-o020b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0162","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o020b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0020","role":"被破","evidence":["zhangle-e-o020b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹操领兖州以后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o020b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o020b-q","source_order":[17,73,"O020b"],"order":3520}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0020","name":"高雅","evidence":["zhangle-q-o020"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o020-zhangle-p0020","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o020"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o020b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-268a3271c0ec48659996","layer":"original","quote":"从讨吕布于濮阳，别破布二营于城南；又别将破高雅于须昌。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":74,"end":101},{"id":"zhangle-q-o020","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-268a3271c0ec48659996","layer":"original","quote":"及太祖领兖州，禁与其党俱诣，为都伯〖2〗，属将军王朗。朗异之，荐禁才任大将（军）。太祖召见，与语，拜军司马；使将兵诣徐州，攻广戚；拔之，拜陷阵都尉。从讨吕布于濮阳，别破布二营于城南；又别将破高雅于须昌。从攻寿张、定陶、离狐〖3〗，围张超于雍丘，皆拔之。从征黄巾刘辟、黄邵等，屯版梁；邵等夜袭太祖营，禁帅麾下击破之，斩（辟）邵等，尽降其众。迁平虏校尉〖4〗。从围桥蕤于苦，斩蕤等四将。从至宛，降张绣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":199}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
